{"id": "|679A1E4A46FAFB848BEB8796806CDFC9", "source_en": "A calcified cluster of Anima, often mistaken for a simple stone. This rock brims with life in the hands of a Nephilim and seeps its essence into their soul.The calcification of Anima is a somber affair, only rested its fate by the hands of a Nephilim.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "كتلة متكلسة من الأنيما، غالباً ما تُظن مجرد حجر بسيط. ينبض هذا الحجر بالحياة بين يدي النيفيليم وتتسرب جوهرته إلى روحهم. إن تكلس الأنيما أمر كئيب، لا يهدأ قدره إلا بين يدي النيفيليم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "|906F153A419D32AB45A4F1B0E1B29883", "source_en": "A common curative.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "علاج شائع.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
{"id": "|1694CA224216AA4831AB45BB85429CBD", "source_en": "A little calcified cluster of Anima, often mistaken for a simple stone. This rock slowly brims with life in the hands of a Nephilim and seeps its essence into their soul. Its power is but an echo which remains unheard by most.", "category": "ui_inline", "speaker": null, "ar": "كتلة صغيرة متكلسة من الأنيما، غالباً ما تُظن مجرد حجر بسيط. ينبض هذا الحجر بالحياة ببطء بين يدي النيفيليم وتتسرب جوهرته إلى روحهم. قوته ليست سوى صدى لا يسمعه معظم الناس.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 3}}
